                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>No. Arrangement has been made strictly according to the terms of your telegrams.
                    Upon that basis Cortes will be asked to give favored-nation treatment to
                    American products immediately. Tariff changes may be made by both nations
                    without prejudice, provided neither discriminates against other. If either
                    resolves to discriminate, three months’ notice to be given. Details by next
                    mail.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
